message: "If you use or adapt this manual, please cite it as below."
title: "Rendeiro lab manual"
abstract: >-
  The Rendeiro Lab Manual is a guide to the operations, culture, and best
  practices of the Rendeiro lab at CeMM. It covers onboarding, the code of
  conduct, communication, computational infrastructure, project planning and
  execution, record keeping, data archiving, learning resources, manuscript
  writing, and offboarding.
